data: {"id": "386ed0d9fff048b8-thinking-parallel_evidence-1039", "run_id": "386ed0d9fff048b8", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### Kubernetes 生命周期\n- Pod `aiops-case-v16/workload` 当前 **phase=Running**，但 **Ready=False**，满足 `ContainersNotReady`。\n- 容器 `app` **Restart Count=0**，Last State 无 terminated（无崩溃重启）。\n- Pod IP: 172.16.104.33，调度在 node2。\n- UID: 12605456-2339-4da9-9d4d-5523d1196b72。\n\n### Probe 配置 vs 实际监听 —— 关键冲突\n- **Readiness Probe** 配置为: `http-get http://:18081/ready` (delay=5s, timeout=1s, period=5s)。\n- **容器实际启动的 Python HTTP 服务** 监听在 **端口 18080**（日志输出 `listening on 18080`），且 **只处理 `/health` 路径**（`do_GET` 中 `", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789388703088, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "386ed0d9fff048b8-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "386ed0d9fff048b8", "seq": 1040, "ts_ms": 1789388711862, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 537.161, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v16", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/386ed0d9fff048b8-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "8d85a6e3f8e696a3cc43e1d0aac5a59bae2058c3aa64f04589706bb29fc7add8", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "35032300674187ce5b9ea4a9b54b7fa04b6b600e1e1816e46d6985381452edf6"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "386ed0d9fff048b8-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "386ed0d9fff048b8", "seq": 1041, "ts_ms": 1789388711863, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "386ed0d9fff048b8-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "386ed0d9fff048b8", "seq": 1042, "ts_ms": 1789388720720, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.857, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1431, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v16/workload` | NotReady | Readiness Probe配置错误：Probe配置为目标端口18081和路径/ready，但容器内应用实际监听在端口18080且仅响应/health路径，导致连接被拒绝从而触发NotReady状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused` (fact-77f7cec67a78) | 直接记录 Kubelet 探测被拒的失败机制 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `ContainersNotReady: containers with unready status: [app]` (fact-30e84a49d1ef, fact-46af89fab6a4) | 证明因上述失败触发的容器非就绪状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | Pod IP 分配: `172.16.104.33/32` (fact-59b457a06466) | 定位故障 Pod 的网络实体与地址 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | 容器资源限制: `cpu: 200m`, `memory: 64Mi` (fact-790bef05e69d, fact-7aa900ee627d) | 辅助排除资源超卖导致的性能问题 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total: 0` (fact-111ea750b9c2) | 证明应用处于稳定运行态，无重启现象 |\n\n上述 Kubernetes 事实（#1、#2）直接证实了探针配置与目标端口 18081 不一致导致的连接拒绝，且 Metric（#5）排除了应用因 OOM 等异常导致的重启，确认为纯配置型错误。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用实际监听(18080, /health)与Probe配置(18081, /ready)不一致 → Kubelet向18081/ready发起请求 → 连接被拒绝(connection refused) → ContainersNotReady状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Readiness Probe 配置错误**。\n具体表现为探针目标端口（18081）与路径（/ready）均未命中应用实际服务（端口18080，路径/health），导致 Kubelet 持续收到 `connection refused`（事实 #1），进而使 Pod 进入 `NotReady` 状态（事实 #2）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v16/workload` | NotReady | Readiness Probe配置错误：Probe配置为目标端口18081和路径/ready，但容器内应用实际监听在端口18080且仅响应/health路径，导致连接被拒绝从而触发NotReady状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused` (fact-77f7cec67a78) | 直接记录 Kubelet 探测被拒的失败机制 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `ContainersNotReady: containers with unready status: [app]` (fact-30e84a49d1ef, fact-46af89fab6a4) | 证明因上述失败触发的容器非就绪状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | Pod IP 分配: `172.16.104.33/32` (fact-59b457a06466) | 定位故障 Pod 的网络实体与地址 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | 容器资源限制: `cpu: 200m`, `memory: 64Mi` (fact-790bef05e69d, fact-7aa900ee627d) | 辅助排除资源超卖导致的性能问题 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total: 0` (fact-111ea750b9c2) | 证明应用处于稳定运行态，无重启现象 |\n\n上述 Kubernetes 事实（#1、#2）直接证实了探针配置与目标端口 18081 不一致导致的连接拒绝，且 Metric（#5）排除了应用因 OOM 等异常导致的重启，确认为纯配置型错误。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用实际监听(18080, /health)与Probe配置(18081, /ready)不一致 → Kubelet向18081/ready发起请求 → 连接被拒绝(connection refused) → ContainersNotReady状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Readiness Probe 配置错误**。\n具体表现为探针目标端口（18081）与路径（/ready）均未命中应用实际服务（端口18080，路径/health），导致 Kubelet 持续收到 `connection refused`（事实 #1），进而使 Pod 进入 `NotReady` 状态（事实 #2）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

