data: {"id": "386ed0d9fff048b8-final", "run_id": "386ed0d9fff048b8", "seq": 1044, "ts_ms": 1789388720730, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v16/workload` | NotReady | Readiness Probe配置错误：Probe配置为目标端口18081和路径/ready，但容器内应用实际监听在端口18080且仅响应/health路径，导致连接被拒绝从而触发NotReady状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused` (fact-77f7cec67a78) | 直接记录 Kubelet 探测被拒的失败机制 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `ContainersNotReady: containers with unready status: [app]` (fact-30e84a49d1ef, fact-46af89fab6a4) | 证明因上述失败触发的容器非就绪状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | Pod IP 分配: `172.16.104.33/32` (fact-59b457a06466) | 定位故障 Pod 的网络实体与地址 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | 容器资源限制: `cpu: 200m`, `memory: 64Mi` (fact-790bef05e69d, fact-7aa900ee627d) | 辅助排除资源超卖导致的性能问题 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total: 0` (fact-111ea750b9c2) | 证明应用处于稳定运行态，无重启现象 |\n\n上述 Kubernetes 事实（#1、#2）直接证实了探针配置与目标端口 18081 不一致导致的连接拒绝，且 Metric（#5）排除了应用因 OOM 等异常导致的重启，确认为纯配置型错误。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用实际监听(18080, /health)与Probe配置(18081, /ready)不一致 → Kubelet向18081/ready发起请求 → 连接被拒绝(connection refused) → ContainersNotReady状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Readiness Probe 配置错误**。\n具体表现为探针目标端口（18081）与路径（/ready）均未命中应用实际服务（端口18080，路径/health），导致 Kubelet 持续收到 `connection refused`（事实 #1），进而使 Pod 进入 `NotReady` 状态（事实 #2）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 9.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 13.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 537.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v16/workload: 537.2s (Evidence 528.5s, RCA 8.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v16/workload**: pod-notready-probe-failed, pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 559.369, "metrics": {"run_id": "386ed0d9fff048b8", "mttr": {"value": "9.3m", "seconds": 559.3869304656982, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 559386.9304656982, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 554147.7375030518, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 13247.11012840271, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4837.018251419067}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 13335.81566810608, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 537161.0238552094, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8856.548309326172, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

